      hu: ["A Hehuanshan főcsúcsának magassága 3416 méter", "2019-ben Tajvan első Nemzetközi Sötét Égbolt Parkja lett", "A Wuling-hágó a legmagasabb pont az úton, 3275 méteren", "A hegy kőzetanyaga metamorf pala és homokkő", "Tavasszal itt virágzik a ritka Yushan-rododendron", "Télen a hó vastagsága elérheti a több tíz centimétert is"],
      ro: ["Vârful principal Hehuanshan are o altitudine de 3416 metri", "Desemnat primul Parc de Cer Întunecat din Taiwan în 2019", "Pasul Wuling de pe șoseaua adiacentă se află la 3275 metri", "Geologia este dominată de straturi de ardezie și gresie", "Găzduiește specii endemice de rododendron care înfloresc în mai", "Temperaturile pot scădea sub -10 grade Celsius în timpul iernii"],
      en: ["The main peak of Hehuanshan reaches an elevation of 3,416 meters", "Designated as Taiwan's first International Dark Sky Park in 2019", "The nearby Wuling Pass is the highest paved point in Taiwan at 3,275m", "The mountain is geologically composed of slate and sandstone layers", "It is a primary habitat for the endemic Yushan Rhododendron", "Snow accumulation can occur from December through February"],
