      en: ["The area sits at an average elevation of 1,950 meters above sea level.", "Commercial logging operations were officially terminated in 1982.", "Cuifeng Lake covers 25 hectares, making it the largest alpine lake in Taiwan.", "Snowfall is recorded in the area during winters when temperatures drop below 0°C.", "Some ancient cypress trees in the forest are over 2,500 years old.", "The Hatun Hot Springs feature water temperatures as high as 97 degrees Celsius."],
      es: ["La altura es de 1.914 metros.", "La montaña tiene una prominencia de unos 300 metros.", "El Bosque Nacional Taipingshan abarca 1.165 hectáreas.", "El ciprés más antiguo tiene más de 2.000 años.", "La temperatura media anual es de 15°C.", "Cerca de 200.000 turistas visitan Taipingshan cada año."],
      pt: ["A altitude é de 1.914 metros.", "A montanha tem uma proeminência de cerca de 300 metros.", "A Floresta Nacional de Taipingshan abrange 1.165 hectares.", "O cipreste mais antigo tem mais de 2.000 anos.", "A temperatura média anual é de 15°C.", "Cerca de 200.000 turistas visitam Taipingshan anualmente."],
      fr: ["L'altitude est de 1 914 mètres.", "La montagne a une hauteur de culminance d'environ 300 mètres.", "La forêt nationale de Taipingshan couvre 1 165 hectares.", "Le plus vieux cyprès a plus de 2 000 ans.", "La température moyenne annuelle est de 15°C.", "Environ 200 000 touristes visitent Taipingshan chaque année."],
